    {
      "entity_id": "mention:0d0dcb97cc17a76be25e57d7",
      "predicate": "SOURCE_STATEMENT",
      "value": "In the summer of 1602, the Spanish pirate Alonso de Contreras sought refuge on the deserted islands of Phournoi with his Maltese frigate and companions, following a series of successful operations in Serifos, Astypalaia, Amorgos and Patmos, intending to regroup and divide their spoils.",
